  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original Belosaepia-inspired internal-shell specimen only: a thick posterior body joins a long gently curved posterior prong and broad thin anterior shield/deck through one continuous shell volume. Relative thickness and outward flare are readable; microscopic chambers, soft cuttlefish, arms and inferred living body proportions are omitted. Nominal11cm, palette and presentation are artistic, not a copied fossil or exact species measurement.",
    "zh": "原创Belosaepia启发内壳标本：厚后体、较长微弯后刺与前扩薄盾板/腹板为单一连续壳体，厚薄层次和外展可读。省微壳室，不补软体乌贼腕或生活比例。名义11厘米、配色与展示属美术，非化石复制或精确种级测量。"
  },
